{
  "step": "Specification",
  "expectations": {
    "create": [
      "SPEC"
    ]
  },
  "prompt": "Under the folder 'STATIC' is a static analysis and under the folder 'DYNAMIC' is a dynamic analysis of a set of file(s). Create a specification which is sufficient to perform a clean-room implementation of the functionality of the original files without adding any internal implementation details of the previous reverse engineered artifacts. Create a folder 'SPEC' which contains all necessary specification files. If something goes wrong create the file ERROR/SPEC.md and document the issue there."
}
